# Worf, Defiant Commander in a duel. "When Worf enters, create a 2/1 red Klingon Warrior creature token with haste"
# (CR 603.6a, 701.7): the 2/1 red hasty Klingon Warrior arrives under Bot1. "Battlefront — Whenever you attack, exile the
# top X cards of your library, where X is the number of opponents you attacked this turn" (CR 508.1): one opponent
# attacked, so one card (a Plains) is exiled and nothing of Bot2's library is touched. "Until the end of your next turn,
# you may play those cards": on Bot1's next turn the Plains is played from exile as the land for the turn (CR 305.1).

